  "2026-11-11T23:54:22.048Z",codex-github230-1111,"Final fixture tightening: the dependency-race regression now delegates listing to the real SDK and uses the real default ordering-cycle collector. The exact command node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-name-pattern \"^Ownership dependency writes\" test/import-ownership.test.ts passes 1/1. In a disposable package copy, disabling only assertGithubImportOwner makes that same case fail 1/1; restoring it passes 1/1. Final test compilation and lint pass. This strengthens the existing 22-case behavioral revert proof without changing production code, test counts or the gate receipt. All tracker histories remain byte-prefix extensions of the accepted base and origin/main. Releasing only this author claim before commit; no item is closed."
